  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk / Tax Collector | Pittsfield, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     About Pittsfield   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     Schools   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Dog Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Election Results \r\n\t\t\t How to Register to Vote \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle and Boat Registration \r\n\t\t\t Property Taxes \r\n\t\t\t Town Clerk/Tax Collector Responsbilities \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t State Primary 2026 \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector\t\t \r\nMinutes \nMinutes are available and approved. \nView Most Recent Minutes \nStaff \nErica Anthony , Town Clerk (Tax Collector) \nGreta Sarte, Deputy Town Clerk (Tax Collector) \nThis office is staffed by a Town Clerk/Tax Collector and a Deputy Town Clerk/Tax Collector. Together, they perform a variety of record-keeping and revenue-collecting assignments. \nThe Town Clerk is the keeper of the records and handles questions regarding: \nTown Records \nVehicle Registrations \nBoat Registrations \nOHRV Registrations \nHunting and Fishing Licenses \nVital Records, including: Marriage Licenses, Birth and Death Certificates \nDog Licenses \nWetland Applications \nVoter Registration \nAbsentee Ballots \nElections \nTax Collection: \nDirect your questions to this office if they pertain to the following: \nCollection of Property Taxes \nCollection of Sewer Fees \nCollection of Land Use Change Tax \nCollection of Timber (Yield) Tax \nCollection of Excavation Tax \nQuestions regarding the assessment of the above-mentioned taxes/fees should be directed to the Selectmen's Office. \nNews & Announcements \r\n\t NOTICE - Public Hearing - SCHOOL DISTRICT TAX/ SAU BUDGET LIMITATION  \r\nNotice of Public Hearing for Pittsfield School Board\t\t\t\t Read on... \r\n\t Notice - State General Election  \r\n\t\t\t\t Read on... \r\n\t\t View All News \r\n/CivicAlerts.aspx \r\nContact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t\tErica Anthony\r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\nEmail Erica  \r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n View Map \t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t 85 Main Street \n\t\t\t\t\t Pittsfield ,  NH   03263 \r\n 85 Main Street Pittsfield NH 03263 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Directions \r\nPhone:  603-435- 6773 Ext. 1 \r\nFax: 603-435-7922 \r\nHours: \nMonday 11 am - 7 pm \nTuesday 8 am - 4 pm \nWednesday  CLOSED \nThursday 7 am - 4 pm \nFriday 8 am - 4 pm \r\nDirectory \r\nContact Us \r\nTown of Pittsfield \n85 Main Street \nPittsfield, NH 03263 \nPhone: 603-435-6773 \nFax: 603-435-7922 \n[email protected]          \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Directory \n         Contact Us \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         View All Quick Links \r\n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
